  "description": "The meme references the idea of a 'talking doll,' which is a real-world toy category. The humor (or hate) stems from the absurdity of a doll that speaks, especially when combined with the stereotype of Muslims being 'incomprehensible.' This requires knowledge of toy culture and the concept of interactive toys.",
